  "title": "Awesome Ham Pasta Salad",
  "description": "This ham and ziti pasta salad is perked up with colorful bell peppers, red onion, sweet pickles and cherry tomatoes. It’s tossed with a sweet and tangy dressing.",
  "authors": [
    "Karena"
  ],
